                                 typographic punctuation (em/en-dash, curly quotes, ellipsis, bullet,
                                 daggers, primes, per-mille), super/subscripts (x², H₂O), the full
                                 Currency block, the Letterlike block (№ ™ ℗ Ω Å ℃ ℉, script/double-
                                 struck letters), vulgar fractions + Roman numerals, and Greek. Noto
                                 core carries NO arrows, box-drawing, block elements, geometric shapes,
                                 dingbats (check/cross), technical or comparison-math operators, so
                                 those are dropped — use lucide icons or an <extraFonts> merge for them. -->
